        "original_id": "b5910ed4-abf5-5c34-8bcd-cd611a701891",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arthur Noss, Keith Park\n- Roles: gunner, operational commander\n- Events: Second World War, Battle of Britain, Battle of Malta, flying accident\n- Awards: Military Cross\n\nFacts:\n- During the Second World War, Keith Park was in operational command during the Battle of Britain and the Battle of Malta in the European theatre.\n- Keith Park helped to win the Battle of Britain and the Battle of Malta.\n- Arthur Noss won a Military Cross as Keith Park's gunner.\n- Arthur Noss was killed in a flying accident shortly after winning the Military Cross.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
